    {
      "title": "Values & data types",
      "level": 3,
      "scope": "locale",
      "intro": "",
      "columns": {
        "en": 0,
        "target": 1,
        "use": 2,
        "notes": 3
      },
      "terms": [
        {
          "en": "value",
          "target": "قيمة",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "Ordinary word.",
          "anchor": "term-value"
        },
        {
          "en": "number",
          "target": "عدد",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "`عدد` for the data-type sense (`عدد صحيح`, `عدد عشري`); `رقم` is reserved for \"digit/numeral\", not this term.",
          "anchor": "term-number"
        },
        {
          "en": "true / false",
          "target": "صحيح / خطأ",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "Not capitalised in prose. The literal code keywords `True`/`False` stay in English inside code, per `global/rules.md`.",
          "anchor": "term-true-false"
        },
        {
          "en": "character",
          "target": "حرف",
          "use": "ar",
          "anchor": "term-character"
        },
        {
          "en": "integer",
          "target": "عدد صحيح",
          "use": "ar",
          "anchor": "term-integer"
        },
        {
          "en": "float / decimal",
          "target": "عدد عشري",
          "use": "ar",
          "anchor": "term-float-decimal"
        },
        {
          "en": "array / list",
          "target": "مصفوفة",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "Exercise prose that informally says \"list\" for the same concept as \"array\" also uses `مصفوفة`; see `global/terms.md`. Distinct from the \"chain\" physical metaphor, see below.",
          "anchor": "term-array-list"
        },
        {
          "en": "dictionary",
          "target": "قاموس",
          "use": "ar",
          "anchor": "term-dictionary"
        },
        {
          "en": "element",
          "target": "عنصر",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "e.g. `عناصر المصفوفة` (array elements).",
          "anchor": "term-element"
        },
        {
          "en": "index",
          "target": "فهرس",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "Distinct from `مؤشر` (pointer); do not confuse the two.",
          "anchor": "term-index"
        },
        {
          "en": "key-value pair",
          "target": "زوج (مفتاح - قيمة)",
          "use": "ar",
          "anchor": "term-key-value-pair"
        },
        {
          "en": "string",
          "target": "سلسلة نصية",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "Always the full qualified compound; never shortened to bare `سلسلة`. See guide § \"The سلسلة collision.\"",
          "anchor": "term-string"
        },
        {
          "en": "Boolean",
          "target": "قيمة منطقية",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "Translated fully, unlike some other Jiki languages that keep \"Boolean\" in English; see guide § \"Loanword policy.\"",
          "anchor": "term-boolean"
        },
        {
          "en": "data type",
          "target": "نوع البيانات",
          "use": "ar",
          "anchor": "term-data-type"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Functions & control flow",
      "level": 3,
      "scope": "locale",
      "intro": "",
      "columns": {
        "en": 0,
        "target": 1,
        "use": 2,
        "notes": 3
      },
      "terms": [
        {
          "en": "if statement",
          "target": "جملة شرطية",
          "use": "ar",
          "anchor": "term-if-statement"
        },
        {
          "en": "condition",
          "target": "شرط",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "Ordinary word; stands alone.",
          "anchor": "term-condition"
        },
        {
          "en": "comparison",
          "target": "مقارنة",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "Ordinary word; stands alone.",
          "anchor": "term-comparison"
        },
        {
          "en": "expression",
          "target": "تعبير",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "Distinct from \"statement\" below; an expression evaluates to a value.",
          "anchor": "term-expression"
        },
        {
          "en": "operator",
          "target": "عامل",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "e.g. `عوامل المقارنة` (comparison operators). Distinct from `معامل` (parameter); do not confuse the two despite the visual similarity.",
          "anchor": "term-operator"
        },
        {
          "en": "NOT operator / logical negation",
          "target": "عامل النفي",
          "use": "ar",
          "anchor": "term-not-operator-logical-negation"
        },
        {
          "en": "statement (executable)",
          "target": "عبارة",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "The imperative sense: a line of code that does something and gets executed. Kept distinct from `جملة شرطية` (if statement) and from `تعبير` (expression).",
          "anchor": "term-statement"
        },
        {
          "en": "statement (logical claim)",
          "target": "قضية",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "The proposition sense: a claim that is true or false. Pick by meaning, not by the English word; kept distinct from `عبارة` above.",
          "anchor": "term-statement-2"
        },
        {
          "en": "function",
          "target": "دالة",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "The *keyword* `function` in code stays English; the concept in prose is `دالة`.",
          "anchor": "term-function"
        },
        {
          "en": "to call (a function)",
          "target": "يستدعي (استدعاء)",
          "use": "ar",
          "anchor": "term-to-call"
        },
        {
          "en": "to define (a function)",
          "target": "يُعرّف (تعريف)",
          "use": "ar",
          "anchor": "term-to-define"
        },
        {
          "en": "parameter",
          "target": "معامل",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "The declaration-site name. Distinct from `عامل` (operator); do not confuse the two.",
          "anchor": "term-parameter"
        },
        {
          "en": "argument",
          "target": "وسيط",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "The call-site value.",
          "anchor": "term-argument"
        },
        {
          "en": "input (to a function)",
          "target": "مدخل / مدخلات",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "Plural `مدخلات` is the natural form in prose.",
          "anchor": "term-input"
        },
        {
          "en": "output",
          "target": "مخرج / مخرجات",
          "use": "ar",
          "anchor": "term-output"
        },
        {
          "en": "to return (a value)",
          "target": "يُرجع",
          "use": "ar",
          "anchor": "term-to-return"
        },
        {
          "en": "return value",
          "target": "القيمة المرجعة",
          "use": "ar",
          "notes": "Kept distinct from the verb above.",
          "anchor": "term-return-value"
        },
        {
          "en": "pure function",
          "target": "دالة نقية",
          "use": "ar",
          "anchor": "term-pure-function"
        }
      ]
    },
